{"id": "19478", "revid": "2441334", "url": "https://en.wikivoyage.org/wiki?curid=19478", "title": "Leonardtown", "text": "Leonardtown is a city in Southern Maryland.\nGet in.\nBy car.\nLeonardtown is on Route 5 about 1.5 hours from Annapolis and 1 hour from Washington D.C. The Southern Maryland express can take visitors between the area and major airports nearby.\nSee.\nLeonardtown has a vibrant arts and entertainment district, home to a music school, art galleries, a chocolatier, a painting studio, and shops for antiques and flowers.\nBuy.\nThe local Amish communities have auctions where they sell crafts like quilts."}
